k: Chrome Extension</li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit;\">PC:Chrome Extension</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Dimensions:<br>7&rdquo; (L) x 2.8&rdquo; (W) x 1.19&rdquo; (H)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(9, 26, 49); font-family: Madera, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(9, 26, 49); font-family: Madera, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(9, 26, 49); font-family: Madera, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</div>",
